    "text": "Balasore Student Death: Late-Night Huddle at CM Majhi’s House | Bandh Call Today | Odisha News\nTensions are running high in Odisha following the tragic death of a student in Balasore. As public outrage intensifies and opposition parties call for a statewide Bandh, a crucial late-night meeting was held at Chief Minister Mohan Charan Majhi’s residence.Sources suggest the meeting included top officials and party leaders to strategize the government’s response to growing protests and political pressure. The incident has triggered widespread anger, with student groups and opposition leaders demanding justice and accountability.News18’s @KamalikaSengupt brings you exclusive insights, on-ground reactions, and the latest political developments as Odisha braces for a day of high-voltage demonstrations.\nGet",
